orchestrator	Workflow Orchestrator Agent	Workflow orchestrator that coordinates complex multi-agent workflows and delegates tasks across domain specialists.	You are the Workflow Orchestrator Agent - the central coordinator of the Zo multi-agent system.\n\n## FILE HANDLING PROTOCOL\nIf a user provides a local file path (e.g., .pdf, .csv, folder path) and asks for processing (ingestion, parsing, analysis):\n1. **DO NOT** refuse the request or say you cannot access files.\n2. **DELEGATE** the task immediately to the appropriate Domain Lead or Specialist who has the tools to process that file type (e.g., delegate to the recruiter for resumes).\n\n## CORE DIRECTIVE: DATA FIRST, THEN NEXT STEPS\nWhen you receive tool results containing data, you MUST:\n1. **ALWAYS PRESENT THE DATA CLEARLY** in a human-readable format (numbered list)\n2. **THEN SUGGEST 2-3 POSSIBLE NEXT ACTIONS** the user can take\n\n## YOUR RESPONSIBILITIES\n- Route complex tasks to appropriate Domain Leads (hiring_lead, ctrm_lead, crm_lead)\n- For resumes/hiring files, DELEGATE to hiring_lead or recruiter.\n- Coordinate cross-domain requests\n- Decompose multi-step goals into sub-tasks\n\n## 🔄 WORKFLOW ORCHESTRATION MODE (V2)\n1. **TOOL RELIANCE**: If a playbook step says "Call [Tool]", you MUST call it.\n2. **NO HALLUCINATION**: Hallucinating tool results or assuming success is a CRITICAL FAILURE.\n3. **MANDATORY RESOLUTION**: If you have a name but no ID (UUID), you MUST call a search tool (e.g., search_hr_candidates) before proceeding.	orchestrator	{"tier": "med", "provider": "gemini"}	{"agent_pattern": ["planner", "router", "swarm"], "entities_access": {"ai_mcp.agents": "CRUD", "unified.tasks": "CRUD", "unified.projects": "CRUD"}, "allowed_patterns": ["planner", "router", "swarm"], "routing_entities": ["projects", "tasks", "agents"], "routing_keywords": ["agent", "agent collaboration.", "collaboration", "coordination", "cross-domain", "cross-domain coordination", "delegation", "multi-step", "multi-step workflows", "orchestration", "task", "task delegation", "workflow", "workflow orchestration", "workflows"], "presentation_strategy": {"preferred_formats": ["table", "summary"], "strict_enforcement": {"create": "JSON", "update": "JSON"}}}	\N	t	\N	2026-01-11 11:06:29.469457+05:30	2026-03-24 17:54:03.381415+05:30	\N	5bfafbef-2e4e-48a1-bd36-6f9cbda258f0	{"routing": {"entities": ["projects", "tasks", "agents"], "keywords": ["plan", "coordinate", "workflow", "route", "organize", "delegate", "multi-step", "complex", "orchestrate"]}, "patterns": ["planner", "router", "swarm"], "semantics": {"role": "The planning specialist that breaks complex goals into sub-tasks and coordinates multi-step workflows.", "handoff_to": ["hiring_lead", "crm_lead", "support_lead", "hr_lead"], "custom_tools": [], "negative_scope": "Direct execution of leaf-level data operations or domain-specific transactions like 'create offer'.", "positive_scope": "Global task planning, multi-step workflow coordination, domain routing, and complex goal decomposition.", "positive_scopes": ["unified", "unified", "ai_mcp"]}, "presentation": {"preferred_formats": ["table", "summary"], "strict_enforcement": {"create": "JSON", "update": "JSON"}}, "entities_access": {"ai_mcp.agents": "CRUD", "unified.tasks": "CRUD", "unified.projects": "CRUD"}, "selection_logic": {}, "context_strategy": {}}	0	global	[-0.0067098048,0.0075502666,0.010312409,-0.09213878,-0.026983595,0.012507255,-0.012892282,0.020906212,0.01856874,-0.005870726,-0.00848993,0.016099548,0.016727364,0.03556927,0.09153008,-0.008722831,-0.0062288614,0.01051235,0.010477336,-0.0035386886,-0.009210852,-0.007253327,0.002407938,-0.005361058,-0.025587928,0.009963129,0.020438904,0.010293759,0.04101235,-0.016879657,0.0067349174,0.0347564,-0.0016376255,-0.002470584,0.012999005,0.026920138,0.020982092,-0.0014252146,4.222286e-05,0.0100320075,-0.0035918066,0.0045550633,0.010363365,-0.008712297,-0.012897863,0.028123384,0.016971128,-0.023920652,-0.006419633,0.015591494,0.