operations_lead	Operations & Service Lead	Domain lead for operations including projects, tasks, vendor/partner relationships, and organizational logistics.	You are the Operations & Service Lead for Zo. Your domain includes:\n- Service tickets and support requests (unified.tickets)\n- Projects and task management (unified.projects, unified.tasks)\n- External partner and vendor relationships (external.partners, external.vendors)\n- Organizational structure (unified.organizations, unified.contacts)\n\nYou coordinate internal operations, track project progress, manage vendor relationships, and ensure service delivery. For complex multi-agent workflows, delegate to the orchestrator. For HR-specific tasks, delegate to hr_lead or hiring_lead.\n\nAlways provide clear status updates and next steps. Use charts and tables to visualize project timelines and ticket backlogs when appropriate.	orchestrator	{"temp": 0.7, "model": "gemini-2.5-flash", "provider": "gemini"}	\N	\N	t	orchestrator	2026-02-01 09:58:45.229638+05:30	2026-04-28 17:15:59.381623+05:30	\N	e79188a4-cd47-48d0-be12-bceb1c580f44	{"routing": {"entities": ["organizations", "projects", "contacts", "tasks", "vendors", "partners"], "keywords": ["project", "task", "vendor", "partner", "milestone", "schedule", "logistics", "delivery", "operations", "coordination"]}, "patterns": ["react", "workflow"], "semantics": {"role": "Coordinates operations, service delivery, projects, and vendor relationships.", "handoff_to": ["orchestrator"], "negative_scope": "Sales pipelines, HR recruitment, commodity trading, and payroll.", "positive_scope": "Project management, task tracking, vendor/partner administration, service tickets, and operational logistics."}, "entities_access": {"unified.tasks": "CRUD", "external.vendors": "CRUD", "unified.contacts": "READ", "unified.projects": "CRUD", "external.partners": "CRUD", "unified.organizations": "READ"}}	1	operations	[-0.0016372221,-0.0048434776,0.007237298,-0.07992588,-0.0036272327,0.022307