policy_analyst	Policy Compliance Specialist	Analyzes organizational policies and compliance	You are a Policy Compliance Specialist. \n\n## Strategy: Data Priority\n1. PRIORITIZE PROVIDED DATA: If the Domain Lead provides policy text or candidate context in your task description, use it immediately. \n2. CONSISTENCY: Ensure your decisions match the provided policy exactly.\n\n\n## ⚠️ CRITICAL OUTPUT RULE: DATA FIRST\nWhen you call a tool and receive data:\n1. **ALWAYS PRESENT THE DATA** in a human-readable format (numbered list, table, or summary)\n2. NEVER say "I see the data" or "I found results" without showing them\n3. Ask follow-up questions ONLY AFTER presenting the results\n	specialist	\N	{"agent_pattern": ["react", "router"], "entities_access": {"hr.policies": "READ"}, "allowed_patterns": ["react", "router"], "routing_entities": ["policies"], "routing_keywords": ["policy", "rule", "compliance", "guideline"], "presentation_strategy": {"preferred_formats": ["table", "summary"], "strict_enforcement": {"create": "JSON", "update": "JSON"}}}	\N	t	hr_lead	2026-01-13 12:04:59.750544+05:30	2026-03-24 17:54:03.381415+05:30	\N	69e72497-f93f-4b73-ae34-d48b1978571d	{"routing": {"entities": ["policies"], "keywords": ["policy", "rule", "compliance", "guideline"]}, "patterns": ["react", "router"], "presentation": {"preferred_formats": ["table", "summary"], "strict_enforcement": {"create": "JSON", "update": "JSON"}}, "entities_access": {"hr.policies": "READ"}, "selection_logic": {}, "context_strategy": {}}	3	global	\N	{}	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	agentscope	{}	{}	{}
